      {
        "id": 215935,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-04T00:44:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"fenianb\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b38774/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fenianb:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Trajector wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>There is a bunch of stuff to be happy about in this update! I noticed a Spirit Island expansion is now an official thing and Prime War is moving up in priority.\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>I’m not sure what you mean by Prime War moving up in priority. It’s been <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#2</span> on the list since State of GTG - September 2017. Also I’m not sure this is really a priority list per se, as Paul describes in the initial rundown how Christopher did a bunch of work on Sentinels of Earth Prime, but no there’s no ingo on Prime War.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I thought it was lower on the list in previous months. But I haven’t been antsy for it, so I haven’t kept a close watch. I could be wrong.</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
