      {
        "id": 215937,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-04T01:49:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MindWanderer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/48/4816_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MindWanderer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>On one hand, that's a bit disappointing, since we've known for months that they were working on that.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Don't really see how that's disappointing. The history book has been mentioned several times and places but was never mentioned on the timeline. That was a big ol' clue revealing that it was most likely the secret thing anyway.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Hankroyd\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/cc9497/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Hankroyd:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I guess OblivAeon's episode in the Letter Pages will be delayed too.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Just as we know OblivAeon is coming, so is it's episode. Just chill and enjoy the ride, along with all the episode we'll get before then.</p>",
