      {
        "id": 215939,
        "name": "rjc917",
        "username": "rjc917",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rjc917/{size}/1888_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-04T03:52:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dprcooke\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/48/1961_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dprcooke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><a href=\"mailto:disappointed.@speedyolrac\">@speedyolrac</a>, @jffdougan - How do you actually use TTS?&nbsp; I picked it up during the last big Steam Sale, along with the Scythe DLC, and despite going through the tutorial, can't figure out how to actually&nbsp;start <em>playing</em> a game once I've launched it.&nbsp; Are there any good resources you know of?&nbsp; (Specific to Scythe would be great, but I'll take anything at this point.)&nbsp;</div>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I've been wondering this too.&nbsp; I have TTS, but I've never actually played a game on there.&nbsp; I'm not even sure how to get Spirit Island on it, since it's not listed amongst the DLC.</p>",
