        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-04T12:50:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, TTS is all about subscribing to workshop mods and then opening those to play. I recommend configuring them to your liking afterward and then saving a game state. :B</p>",
        "post_number": 30,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:47:30.507Z",
